esult from the corresponding member of *this.","children":[{"label":"Standard library","note":"The following standard library functions use ranges::in_value_result as the return type:"},{"label":"Synopsis"},{"label":"Notes","note":"Each standard library algorithm that uses this family of return types declares a new alias type, e.g. using merge_result = in_in_out_result<I1, I2, O>;."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also"}]}]},"standards":["C++11","C++23"],"wordCount":454,"codeBlockCount":2}
